# One line ending everywhere: a release copy, its digest and every merge are the same on every platform and
# whatever a checkout's core.autocrlf, since a copy cut from a CRLF checkout would carry another digest.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.zip  binary
